# The web image's build context (web/Dockerfile) is the repository root
# (ADR-0092). Everything is left out except what that image builds from, so
# the backend's build output, every node_modules and .git are never sent and
# cannot invalidate its cache.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!web
!packages
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/*.md
web/playwright-report
web/test-results
